---
import { portfolioData } from '../data/portfolio';
---

<section id="about" class="py-20 md:py-32 relative border-t border-surface-border/60">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    
    <!-- Section Title in Lime from Inspiration -->
    <div class="text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-16">
      <span class="text-brand-lime font-mono text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest block mb-2">
        // NILAI & PROSES
      </span>
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl font-extrabold text-brand-lime tracking-tight text-glow">
        SIAPA SAYA ?
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-surface-muted text-base sm:text-lg">
        Bukan sekadar menulis kode, tapi membangun solusi digital yang membuat bisnis Anda dipercaya pelanggan dalam waktu 60 detik.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Bio & Value Proposition Card -->
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto mb-20 bg-surface-card/60 backdrop-blur-xl border border-surface-border rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-10 relative overflow-hidden">
      <!-- Background subtle accent -->
      <div class="absolute -right-20 -top-20 w-60 h-60 bg-brand-lime/5 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>

      <div class="space-y-4 text-slate-300 text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed text-center sm:text-left">
        {portfolioData.personal.bio.map((paragraph) => (
          <p>{paragraph}</p>
        ))}
      </div>

      <div class="mt-8 pt-6 border-t border-surface-border/80 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-4">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
          <div class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-brand-lime animate-ping"></div>
          <span class="text-sm font-semibold text-white">Prinsip Kerja: Jujur, Cepat, & Transparan</span>
        </div>
        
        <a
          href="#projects"
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-5 py-2.5 rounded-full bg-brand-lime hover:bg-brand-lime-light text-surface-bg font-extrabold text-xs uppercase tracking-wider transition-all duration-200"
        >
          <span>Lihat Karya Nyata</span>
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-3.5 h-3.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <polyline points="9 18 15 12 9 6"></polyline>
          </svg>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 4 Langkah Proses Kerja (PRD Section 3 & 5) -->
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto">
      <div class="text-center mb-12">
        <h3 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight">
          4 Langkah Kerja Transparan
        </h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-surface-muted mt-1">
          Alur kerja jelas dari awal diskusi hingga serah terima, tanpa ada kejutan biaya atau jadwal molor.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6">
        {portfolioData.workProcesses.map((step) => (
          <div class="relative group p-6 rounded-2xl bg-surface-card border border-surface-border hover:border-brand-lime/50 transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1">
            <div class="text-3xl font-black font-mono text-brand-lime/30 group-hover:text-brand-lime transition-colors mb-3">
              {step.number}
            </div>
            <h4 class="text-base font-bold text-white mb-2 group-hover:text-brand-lime transition-colors">
              {step.title}
            </h4>
            <p class="text-xs text-surface-muted leading-relaxed">
              {step.description}
            </p>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>

